In 'repo', lock worktree '../mount-tree' with the reason 'external'.
Delete directory '../temp-tree' from disk.
Prune orphaned worktree metadata.
Unlock '../mount-tree'.
Exit the subshell.

Tidbit: 'git worktree lock --reason <msg>' guards an absent tree's metadata
from 'git worktree prune'. 'git worktree unlock' clears the guard.
